{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an RPG-visual novel hybrid, our game offers the best of both worlds \u2014 the rich storytelling and art of a visual novel, and the ability to interact with your environment and the people around you like in RPG games.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of Ciel Rozenbleu to explore Una's three countries \u2014 Desideria, Cantara and Idris!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in a choice-based battle system which takes you through exciting combat scenes featuring full-color comic strips!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delve headfirst into this fantasy world and watch the action, politics, and romance unfold!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/story.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/Story1.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/Story3.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/Story7.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/features.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the world of Stand By Me and\u00a0<strong>explore 40+ maps\u00a0</strong>that span across Desideria, Cantara, and Idris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/cielmirror.gif?t=1745131370\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in a<strong>\u00a0choice-based battle system</strong>\u00a0which takes you through exciting combat scenes featuring dynamic comic strips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker.gif?t=1745131370\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy\u00a0<strong>full-colour character graphics and pixel art</strong>\u00a0for both main and side characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/ezgif-67f536f43fd38d.gif?t=1745131370\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Social Stats System:\u00a0</strong>Interact with the characters around you or do well in battles and you might just learn a thing or two - your progress from an ignorant knucklehead to a wise, powerful sorceress starts here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-11_010109.png?t=1745131370\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The choices you make matter, and can affect your relationships with the 5 love interests. Check the\u00a0<strong>affection menu</strong>\u00a0to see where you stand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/affection.gif?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/characters.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/cieldraft.png?t=1745131370\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/altairdraft.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/ruidraft.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/kieldraft.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/caiusdraft.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/dantedraft.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/about.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/FishAtticGames_2.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/Story6.png?t=1745131370\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd0d Special Thanks:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand By Me PV: sense_aep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game studio logo: IUM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Una Map: SirenSongBoutique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PV Music: Yoshinori Tanaka</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623370/extras/promospirtes.png?t=1745131370\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623370?t=1745131370","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.